<!--
    Shown in place of a prayer's own glyph while its Iqama is counting down.

    A dome, two minarets and a base — the least detail that still reads as a mosque at the twenty
    density-independent pixels this is drawn at, which is why there are no windows, arches or
    finials in it. The dome is deliberately narrower than the base: drawn the same width, the two
    merge into a rounded rectangle at small sizes and the silhouette says nothing.
-->
